Package: hibiiscus
Title: Framework for transferable ecological impact analyses
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Martin",
           family = "Jung",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jung@iiasa.ac.at",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7569-1390"))
Maintainer: Martin Jung <jung@iiasa.ac.at>           
Description: This package uses principles of ecological meta-analysis to assess the impacts of land use and land-use intensity on ecological communities. Data and modelling approach originate from the PREDICTS framework and are adapted for greater transferability, accounting of uncertainty and robustness.
